  "description": "A complete C# port of libebur128 for .NET 10. EBU R128 and ITU-R BS.1770 loudness measurement covering momentary, short term and integrated loudness, loudness range, sample peak and true peak. Measurement runs without a managed allocation and the library is annotated for Native AOT. Every stage is compared against the original C built with MSVC.",
